You are implementing a Blazor Web App for a logistics company that tracks shipments. The project has already been scaffolded at `/tmp/sv-34ee9ff71eef4564a637474f51699aa9/ShipmentTracker/` using `dotnet new blazor -o ShipmentTracker -int Auto -ai -au Individual --no-https`.

